Package: fast.string
Type: Package
Title: Fast Parallel String Functions via PCRE2, RE2 and RcppParallel
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Kyle", "Haynes", email = "kyle@kylehaynes.com.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast equivalents of grepl(), grep(), sub(), and gsub() that
    use PCRE2 (regex) and RE2 StringPiece (fixed strings), parallelised across
    all CPU cores via Intel TBB through RcppParallel. Typically 5-40x faster
    than the equivalent base R functions on large character vectors.
License: Apache License (>= 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
